</div>
<section class="about-us-wrapper">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h1 class="fw-bold">
                <%- helper.getValueFromKey(storeInfo,'NAME') %> -
                    <span class="text-warning">Your Local Travel & Lifestyle Guide</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="lead">Discover the best rooms, rentals, and services around you with ease.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Story -->
        <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-10 col-12">
                <h2 class="mb-3 text-center">Our Story</h2>
                <p>
                    In today's busy world, finding reliable local services can be challenging. We started
                    <strong><%- helper.getValueFromKey(storeInfo,'NAME') %></strong> to connect you with trusted
                    local providers for rooms, cars, bikes, and nearby restaurants — all in your neighborhood.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our vision is simple: To make local services easily accessible, ensuring convenience, safety,
                    and fast support whenever you need it.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Why Choose Us -->
        <h2 class="text-center mb-4">Why Choose Us?</h2>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 text-center border-top border-warning shadow-sm p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-3">⚡ Quick & Easy Booking</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">Book rooms, cars, or bikes instantly. No long waits or complicated procedures.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 text-center border-top border-warning shadow-sm p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-3">🤝 Trusted Local Providers</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">We partner only with verified local service providers to ensure quality and
                        reliability.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 text-center border-top border-warning shadow-sm p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5 mb-3">🔄 Flexible Options</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">Need to change your booking? Modify or cancel easily with no hassle.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Promise -->
        <div class="bg-dark text-white rounded-3 text-center p-5 mt-5">
            <h2 class="text-warning mb-3">Our Promise</h2>
            <p class="h5 mb-3">"Reliable, Fast, and Local — Always at Your Service."</p>
            <p>We make exploring your city and accessing local services simple, safe, and enjoyable.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>